            <title>[IGNITE-6578] Too many diagnostic: Found long running cache future</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6578</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Get about 100Mb of message:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;lt;date&amp;gt; &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;WARN&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;grid-timeout-worker-...&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;o.apache.ignite.internal.diagnostic&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Found long running cache future &amp;lt;future&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
